{"id":"623111","name":"萝卜丝饼","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623111/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青萝卜","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"480g"},{"name":"40度温水","amount":"240g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"4g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜去皮。","img":"images/623111/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"擦成丝。","img":"images/623111/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加盐腌15分钟，泻水。","img":"images/623111/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"萝卜丝中加入所有调料，搅匀。","img":"images/623111/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入一丢丢面粉，搅匀。","img":"images/623111/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入虾皮，搅匀。","img":"images/623111/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，放入冰箱冷藏。","img":"images/623111/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面粉和温水和白砂糖和酵母称重好，放入面包机容器中。","img":"images/623111/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"按饺子皮功能揉面。","img":"images/623111/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉好的面放入比较大的容器中，常温发酵一小时，再放冰箱冷藏，明早做饼。","img":"images/623111/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"发好的面团一分为二。","img":"images/623111/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"揉成长条。","img":"images/623111/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切成剂子，压扁。","img":"images/623111/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"擀成圆圆饼皮。","img":"images/623111/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/623111/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包成包子。","img":"images/623111/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用擀面杖擀圆。","img":"images/623111/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"平底锅预热，倒少许油，小火煎。","img":"images/623111/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"两面各煎四分钟左右。","img":"images/623111/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"两面煎黄。","img":"images/623111/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/623111/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}